      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NANGAR POLLY (8) is rarely far away but tends to find one better, placing 17 from 30 starts. Continues to race well, filling the minors at the last five starts, the latest when third (34.66) at this track. Has never missed the frame here at the trip from five starts. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Sure to be about the mark. FIRETHORN (5) missed the frame latest when eighth at Wentworth Park (42.48) but scored four back at Grafton (37.97). Returns to favourable track. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Should be in this for a long way. BARTLETT (1) jumps up sharply in distance this time. CLASSY HUNTER (2) is a R L Evans-trained newcomer by Mepunga Blazer out of Classy Witch. Gets every chance from the inside draw. Profiles well so pay to keep very safe.",
